            <p class="headline">BIS STAGEPLAN SEPTEMBER 2001</p>
            <p align="center"><img src="images/stageplan.jpg" width="480"> </p>
            <p class="headline">Description</p>
            <p>1. John vocal<br>
              2. Amanda vocal<br>
              3. Steven vocal<br>
              4. John Guitar amp<br>
              5. Steven Guitar amp<br>
              6. Sequencer/mixer<br>
              7. Bass synth amp<br>
              8. John keyboards<br>
              9. Amanda keyboards<br>
              10.Steven keyboards<br>
              11.Graham Drum Kit</p>
            <p><br>
              <span class="headline">Monitors</span></p>
            <p>6 x front wedges<br>
              1 x drum fill</p>
            <p>The band require at MINIMUM four sufficiently powerful monitors 
              across the front of the stage.</p>
            <p class="headline">Stage Dimensions</p>
            <p>The stage must be deep enough to support a full drum kit with one 
              band member having sufficient space in front. There must also be 
              enough width to support the three members across the front who need 
              space for keyboards, guitars, dancing etc.</p>
            <p><br>
              <span class="headline">Suggested Channel List</span></p>
            <p>Channel Description Mic/DI/XLR</p>
            <p>1 Mix L (from stage mixer) XLR<br>
              2 Mix R (from stage mixer) XLR<br>
              3 John vocal mic Mic SM58<br>
              4 Amanda vocal mic Mic SM58<br>
              5 Steven vocal mic Mic SM58<br>
              6 John guitar amp mic Mic<br>
              7 Steven guitar amp mic Mic<br>
              8 Bass synth DI<br>
              9 John keyboard 1 DI <br>
              10 John keyboard 2 DI<br>
              11 Amanda keyboard DI <br>
              12 Steven keyboard mix(stage mix) DI<br>
              13 Kick Mic<br>
              14 Snare Mic<br>
              15 Hats Mic<br>
              16 Hi Tom Mic<br>
              17 Floor Tom Mic<br>
              18 OH L Mic <br>
              19 OH R Mic</p>
            <p></p>
            <p>FX, compressors etc.</p>
            <p>2 x auxiliary FX units<br>
              8 x compressor/gate</p>
            <p>These specifications were updated on 28th August 2001.</p>
            <p class="headline"><br>
              Rider</p>
            <p>Meals for 7 people (4 vegetarian)<br>
              If catering not available, $7 p.p buy-out.</p>
            <p>36 cans/bottles of beer<br>
              1 bottle of dry white wine<br>
              1 bottle of vodka<br>
              pure orange juice<br>
              pineapple juice<br>
              coke<br>
              water, in small bottles (20)<br>
              red bull (or equivalent energy drink)</p>
            <p>cup noodles (vegetarian) + kettle available<br>
              coffee and tea</p>
            <p>tomato salsa with plain dipping chips<br>
              variety of normal and low-fat crisps (chips) and chocolates<br>
              pretzels<br>
              brown rolls, butter and cheese slices
           
